# Unsorted GEORADIUS/GEORADIUSBYMEMBER result ordering follows global geohash-score order,
# not Redis's geohash-neighbor cell-scan order (center box, then N/S/E/W, then diagonals).
# The result SET is identical (Redis's box scan is a scan-pruning optimization and still
# filters every candidate by true haversine distance, exactly as we do), and Redis documents
# unsorted GEORADIUS order as unspecified. Only this test pins the cell-scan tie order.
